  "description": "Self-owned resilience library for .NET. The 1.0 kernel is a circuit breaker with two trip triggers (failure ratio and consecutive failures), a sliding sample window, an injectable clock, state observation with manual control, and an invertible health-signal contract. The kernel takes no third-party resilience dependency.",
